[en.FOCUS_C12_MARCH_TO_THE_BATTLEFIELD]
March to the Battlefield

[en.FOCUS_C12_MARCH_TO_THE_BATTLEFIELD_desc]
Although we cherish peace and strive to provide everypony at the rock farm with a happy and tranquil life, the world’s situation is rapidly deteriorating. The Windigos howl above all living beings. At the very least, we must be capable of protecting ourselves. Starting tomorrow, our production lines will yield not only tractors and trucks but also tanks and mighty cannons.\u200b

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MARCH_TO_THE_BATTLEFIELD]
走向战场

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MARCH_TO_THE_BATTLEFIELD_desc]
纵然我们爱好和平，寻求给采石农场的每一匹小马都带来幸福平和的生活，但是世界局势正在迅速恶化，风之魔在所有生灵的头顶呼啸，我们至少要能做到保护自己，从明天开始，从生产线上走下来的不仅只是拖拉机和卡车，而还有坦克和巨炮。

